    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents the full logical state of a 3x3 Rubik&apos;s Cube. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The cube consists of 27 cubies stored in a fixed-size array. State updates occur in two stages:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Permuting cubie positions (shuffling pointers in the array)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Updating cubie internal orientation (calling ApplyMove on individual cubies) </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
